Lab check
; A stand-alone archive (needs-base "-") needs nothing of UP-Term: nothing to check, and no
; look at an UP-Term: assign (EXISTS UP-Term:... asks for the volume when it is not there).
Delete >NIL: ENV:UPTCHECK QUIET
; a record the old Installer left under the former name (dist/package-renames.txt)
@RENAMERECORD@
If NOT "{STEP}" EQ ""
  Quit 0
EndIf
